05c, 06c, 08a, 08b, 08c and the five spelling, placement and","-tagging choices of 02a, 03a, 03d, 04a, 08xa); the rest are choices","-about what the text says, and each is a sentence that can be struck","+Fourteen of the thirty-nine are bibliographic or typographic: S2, 02b,","+02d, 05c, 06c, 08a, 08b, 08c, 11g, and the five spelling, placement and","+tagging choices of 02a, 03a, 03d, 04a, 08xa. The rest are choices","+about what the text says. Each is a sentence that can be struck"," without touching any number."," "," \\subsection{What this does not claim}"]},{"oldStart":156,"oldLines":8,"newStart":176,"newLines":9,"lines":["   are Sections~\\ref{sec:statement}, \\ref{sec:proof} and","   \\ref{sec:replay}'s."," \\item \\textbf{The list of open questions is complete to the day it was","-  written.} Entries added after it, by the reading of the whole paper","-  that follows this draft, are in the file and not here.","+  last re-counted}, 2026-11-05, and includes the entries of the reading","+  of the whole paper and of the final pass. Any entry added after that","+  day is in the file and not here."," \\item \\textbf{No question is answered here.} Each entry records a","   choice and what would change; the author's answer, where there is","   one, is in the file's ``Owner resolutions'' and in the text."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/al/dev/MOSP/paper3/latex/sec10_conclusion.tex"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019nX6yN5A279EkvmHKkVUXN","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
