{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LtRncoGUTs3twDqxLSxVhL","type":"tool_result","content":"   330\tline~15). The theorem statement itself, from \\texttt{theorem\n   331\texact\\_count\\_and\\_sat} to \\texttt{:= by}, is identical in the two files,\n   332\t1,353 characters raw and 1,124 after normalisation, at line~194 of the\n   333\tchallenge and line~74 of \\clonefile{SqrtLogSpace/Final.lean}; the\n   334\tchallenge's proof is the single word \\texttt{sorry} at its line~218.\n   335\t\n   336\t\\subsection{The keyword sweep, item by item}\n   337\t\\label{app:tech-keywords}\n   338\t\n   339\tThis is the detail behind Section~\\ref{sec:proof-keywords}. The only\n   340\t\\texttt{set\\_option}s in the closure are two\n   341\t\\texttt{set\\_option quotPrecheck false}\n   342\t(\\clonefile{SqrtLog/LeafProgramPreparedRecoveryQuery.lean}, line~15, and\n   343\t\\clonefile{SqrtLog/LeafProgramPreparedRecoveryWitness.lean}, line~14),\n   344\twhich switch off a pre-check on local notation and have no bearing on\n   345\tsoundness; there is no \\texttt{maxHeartbeats}, \\texttt{maxRecDepth} or\n   346\t\\texttt{autoImplicit} option anywhere in the closure, and the lakefile\n   347\tsets \\texttt{autoImplicit} to \\texttt{false} for the whole package\n   348\t(\\clonefile{lean/lakefile.lean}, line~9). Nine declarations are\n   349\t\\texttt{opaque}, and every one carries a body: three recovery functions\n   350\t(\\texttt{queryRecovery} at line~59 of\n   351\t\\clonefile{SqrtLog/LeafProgramPreparedRecoveryQuery.lean}, with its\n   352\t\\texttt{:= by} at line~86; \\texttt{rawRecovery} and\n   353\t\\texttt{fixedRecovery} at lines 178 and 198 of\n   354\t\\clonefile{SqrtLog/LeafProgramPreparedRecoveryWitness.lean}) and six\n   355\t\\texttt{private opaque} constants of a subtype\n   356\t\\texttt{\\{ports // ports = \\ldots\\}}, each with an explicit value\n   357\t(line~22 of \\clonefile{SqrtLog/LeafProgramQueryCleanup.lean} and five